lead:SUPERVISOR (fg-server2), warning for design-lap releases: main since a87add7a9 carries a head-start bug. The Rust launch-session gets the raw grant, so secretary and supervisor grants like 'plans/backlog/*' are refused by validate_workspace_paths. S6A is landing the fix as s6/p21-headfix. Releases built from main after a87add7a9 (your b013d10f, a32fc92b and others today) may fail to start the secretary or supervisor head. Hold new activations until headfix lands; I will mail you its sha.